### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

###

### API Info
GET http://localhost:3000/

###

### Create a student
POST http://localhost:3000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNo": "22BCE1001",
  "fullName": "Tenneti Sai Santosh",
  "email": "sai@example.com",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "department": "Computer Science",
  "semester": 5,
  "cgpa": 8.7,
  "admissionYear": 2022
}

###

### Create another student
POST http://localhost:3000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rollNo": "22BCE1002",
  "fullName": "Purnachandra Rao",
  "email": "purna@example.com",
  "phone": "9123456789",
  "department": "Electronics",
  "semester": 5,
  "cgpa": 7.4,
  "admissionYear": 2022
}

###

### Get all students
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students

###

### Filter by department
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students?department=Computer%20Science

###

### Filter by semester
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students?semester=5

###

### Search by name
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students?search=sai

###

### Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students?page=1&limit=5

###

### Sort by CGPA descending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students?sort=-cgpa

###

### Get student by rollNo
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/22BCE1001

###

### Get student by MongoDB ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_ID

###

### Update student
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/students/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "semester": 6,
  "cgpa": 9.1
}

###

### Partial update (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/students/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cgpa": 8.9
}

###

### Delete student
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/students/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_ID

###

### Department-wise statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/students/stats/department

###
